{
 "id": "seg6",
 "title": "页面之外",
 "pill": 6,
 "total": 63.56,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "如果你是普通用户，先记住几条。",
   "spoken": "如果你是普通用户，先记住几条。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg6-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.72,
   "speechStart": 1.692,
   "speechEnd": 4.084
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "收藏官方网址，从收藏夹进入，不点搜索广告和私信链接。",
   "spoken": "收藏官方网址，从收藏夹进入，不点搜索广告和私信链接。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg6-01.wav",
   "start": 4.54,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 4.637,
   "speechEnd": 9.749
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "即使域名正确，签名前也要解码，看清你在签什么。",
   "spoken": "即使域名正确，签名前也要解码，看清你在签什么。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg6-02.wav",
   "start": 10.2,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 10.292,
   "speechEnd": 14.89
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "项目方公告前端异常，立刻停止交互，撤销近期的授权。",
   "spoken": "项目方公告前端异常，立刻停止交互，撤销近期的授权。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg6-03.wav",
   "start": 15.3,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 15.3,
   "speechEnd": 19.752
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "熟悉的网站突然要你重新授权、迁移资产、验证钱包，先停下来核实。",
   "spoken": "熟悉的网站突然要你重新授权、迁移资产、验证钱包，先停下来核实。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg6-04.wav",
   "start": 20.16,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 20.16,
   "speechEnd": 26.203
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "如果你负责前端，今天就问一个问题。",
   "spoken": "如果你负责前端，今天就问一个问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg6-05.wav",
   "start": 26.62,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 26.718,
   "speechEnd": 29.584
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "今晚有人替换了一个脚本文件，谁会在多久之后发现？",
   "spoken": "今晚有人替换了一个脚本文件，谁会在多久之后发现？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg6-06.wav",
   "start": 30.04,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 30.04,
   "speechEnd": 34.429
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "如果你是多签签名人，确认自己有一条不经过这个前端的核对路径。",
   "spoken": "如果你是多签签名人，确认自己有一条不经过这个前端的核对路径。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg6-07.wav",
   "start": 35.18,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 35.281,
   "speechEnd": 40.276
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "回到开头的问题。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg6-08.wav",
   "start": 40.68,
   "dur": 1.36,
   "speechStart": 40.68,
   "speechEnd": 41.861
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "域名是对的，锁也在，不能证明页面是真的。",
   "spoken": "域名是对的，锁也在，不能证明页面是真的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg6-09.wav",
   "start": 42.26,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 42.352,
   "speechEnd": 46.116
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "它只说明你连上了域名此刻指向的服务器，而那台服务器，可能已经换了主人。",
   "spoken": "它只说明你连上了域名此刻指向的服务器，而那台服务器，可能已经换了主人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg6-10.wav",
   "start": 46.56,
   "dur": 6.8,
   "speechStart": 46.652,
   "speechEnd": 53.122
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-11",
   "text": "审计管得住合约，管不住页面，签名之前，独立核对你在签什么。",
   "spoken": "审计管得住合约，管不住页面，签名之前，独立核对你在签什么。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg6-11.wav",
   "start": 53.58,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 53.58,
   "speechEnd": 59.103
  },
  {
